{"id":"219767ec839d8c84","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-numeric-program-interface.md","title":"73-df-numeric-program-interface — Numeric Program and Representation Interface","display":"73-df-numeric-program-interface — Numeric Program and Representation Interface","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-numeric-program-interface","aliases":["73-df-numeric-program-interface"],"display":"73-df-numeric-program-interface — Numeric Program and Representation Interface","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","[[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]","[[73-df-dtm-finite-runs]]","[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","[[73-df-string-function-computation]]","[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-numeric-program-interface"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-numeric-program-interface</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-numeric-program-interface — Numeric Program and Representation Interface"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab6c7ca255afa826\" href=\"?note=ab6c7ca255afa826\" title=\"73-df-oracle-program-semantics\">73-df-oracle-program-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8630ed136c8dde2d\" href=\"?note=8630ed136c8dde2d\" title=\"73-df-dtm-finite-runs\">73-df-dtm-finite-runs</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fd9e85296ed6a24d\" href=\"?note=fd9e85296ed6a24d\" title=\"73-df-string-function-computation\">73-df-string-function-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"11b19b6d211be8ab\" href=\"?note=11b19b6d211be8ab\" title=\"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages\">73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" href=\"?note=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；有限词、自然数元组和函数图采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a> 的类型约定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>普通编号及其函数、集合类固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a>；只有涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^A\">\\(\\varphi_e^A\\)</span> 的子句另外固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OracleProgramCoding}(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O})\">\\(\\operatorname{OracleProgramCoding}(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O})\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"ab6c7ca255afa826\" href=\"?note=ab6c7ca255afa826\" title=\"73-df-oracle-program-semantics\">73-df-oracle-program-semantics</a>。每个包在各自的全部子句中保持同一解释。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Halting}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Halting}_M\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_M^*\">\\(\\to_M^*\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"8630ed136c8dde2d\" href=\"?note=8630ed136c8dde2d\" title=\"73-df-dtm-finite-runs\">73-df-dtm-finite-runs</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}\">\\(C_M^{\\mathsf{init}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a>；神谕配置、初态及闭包关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"ab6c7ca255afa826\" href=\"?note=ab6c7ca255afa826\" title=\"73-df-oracle-program-semantics\">73-df-oracle-program-semantics</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 是下述自然数到二进制词的固定短字典序双射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 是其逆函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,y,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,x,y,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathbf2^*\">\\(w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UnaryHead}(T,y)\">\\(\\operatorname{UnaryHead}(T,y)\\)</span> 检查从位置零开始的全一前缀；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 为满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 的带字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\{1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\Gamma\\setminus\\{1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\in\\Gamma\">\\(1\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma\">\\(T:\\mathbb Z\\to\\Gamma\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:T(i)\\ne b\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0\">\\(|\\{i\\in\\mathbb Z:T(i)\\ne b\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0\\)</span>。普通／神谕程序的实例分别把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 取为各自机器的空白分量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i\">\\(\\pi_i\\)</span> 是从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 开始编号的有序元组投影；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf T=(T_1,\\ldots,T_k)\">\\(\\mathbf T=(T_1,\\ldots,T_k)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf h=(h_1,\\ldots,h_k)\">\\(\\mathbf h=(h_1,\\ldots,h_k)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(f)\">\\(L(f)\\)</span> 中是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\)</span> 的部分函数图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PFun}\">\\(\\operatorname{PFun}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e,\\varphi_e^A\">\\(\\varphi_e,\\varphi_e^A\\)</span> 是下述部分数值函数图，非法程序码处取空图；收敛记号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"773cae915e5165f3\" href=\"?note=773cae915e5165f3\" title=\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumComp}\">\\(\\mathrm{NumComp}\\)</span> 是下述总数值可计算函数类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 是数值集合类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(f)\">\\(L(f)\\)</span> 对部分数值函数图表示其定义域的二进制词表示，不是把函数图误作机器配置。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>普通程序使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}=\\pi_2(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\operatorname{code}=\\pi_2(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>，神谕程序使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ocode}=\\pi_2(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O})\">\\(\\operatorname{ocode}=\\pi_2(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O})\\)</span>；不假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1(\\mathcal E)=\\pi_1(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O})\">\\(\\pi_1(\\mathcal E)=\\pi_1(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O})\\)</span>。两个包的编码函数在各自环境中固定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_O^B\">\\(R_O^B\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"ab6c7ca255afa826\" href=\"?note=ab6c7ca255afa826\" title=\"73-df-oracle-program-semantics\">73-df-oracle-program-semantics</a> 显式定义的一步关系图；闭包调用使用这个图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}\">\\(\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf2}\">\\(\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf2}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\">\\(\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"fd9e85296ed6a24d\" href=\"?note=fd9e85296ed6a24d\" title=\"73-df-string-function-computation\">73-df-string-function-computation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"11b19b6d211be8ab\" href=\"?note=11b19b6d211be8ab\" title=\"73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages\">73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" href=\"?note=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a>。最后的表示对应式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为任意部分函数，不预先假设可计算性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 固定为本文件的同一双射。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\eta(w)\\coloneqq2^{|w|}-1+\\sum_{i=0}^{|w|-1}w(i)2^{|w|-1-i},\\qquad\n\\beta\\coloneqq\\{(n,w)\\in\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbf2^*:n=\\eta(w)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\eta(w)\\coloneqq2^{|w|}-1+\\sum_{i=0}^{|w|-1}w(i)2^{|w|-1-i},\\qquad\n\\beta\\coloneqq\\{(n,w)\\in\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbf2^*:n=\\eta(w)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\beta:\\mathbb N\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbf2^*,\\qquad\n\\widehat A\\coloneqq\\{\\beta(x):x\\in A\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{UnaryHead}(T,y)\\leftrightarrow\ny\\in\\mathbb N\\land T(y)\\ne1\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,y-1\\}\\;T(i)=1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\beta:\\mathbb N\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbf2^*,\\qquad\n\\widehat A\\coloneqq\\{\\beta(x):x\\in A\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{UnaryHead}(T,y)\\leftrightarrow\ny\\in\\mathbb N\\land T(y)\\ne1\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,y-1\\}\\;T(i)=1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\varphi_e\\coloneqq\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\n\\exists M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\;\n(\\operatorname{code}(M)=\\beta(e)\\land\nC_M^{\\mathsf{init}}(\\beta(x))\\to_M^*C\n\\land\\operatorname{Halting}_M(C)\\land\\operatorname{UnaryHead}(\\pi_2(C),y))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\varphi_e\\coloneqq\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\n\\exists M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\;\n(\\operatorname{code}(M)=\\beta(e)\\land\nC_M^{\\mathsf{init}}(\\beta(x))\\to_M^*C\n\\land\\operatorname{Halting}_M(C)\\land\\operatorname{UnaryHead}(\\pi_2(C),y))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\varphi_e^A\\coloneqq\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\n\\exists O\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\;\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\\;\n(\\operatorname{ocode}(O)=\\beta(e)\\land\\pi_1(C)\\in\\{\\pi_8(O),\\pi_9(O)\\}\n\\land(C_O^{\\mathsf{in}}(\\beta(x)),C)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{OConf}_O}(R_O^{\\widehat A})\n\\land\\operatorname{UnaryHead}(\\pi_1(\\pi_2(C)),y))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\varphi_e^A\\coloneqq\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\n\\exists O\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\;\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\\;\n(\\operatorname{ocode}(O)=\\beta(e)\\land\\pi_1(C)\\in\\{\\pi_8(O),\\pi_9(O)\\}\n\\land(C_O^{\\mathsf{in}}(\\beta(x)),C)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{OConf}_O}(R_O^{\\widehat A})\n\\land\\operatorname{UnaryHead}(\\pi_1(\\pi_2(C)),y))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\operatorname{PFun}(\\varphi_e,\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\operatorname{PFun}(\\varphi_e^A,\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\operatorname{PFun}(\\varphi_e,\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\operatorname{PFun}(\\varphi_e^A,\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NumComp}\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N:\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;f=\\varphi_e\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RE}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e):e\\in\\mathbb N\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NumComp}\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N:\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;f=\\varphi_e\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RE}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e):e\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\chi_A\\coloneqq\\{(x,1):x\\in A\\}\\cup\\{(x,0):x\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\chi_A\\in\\mathrm{NumComp}\\},\\qquad\nL(f)\\coloneqq\\{\\beta(x):x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\chi_A\\coloneqq\\{(x,1):x\\in A\\}\\cup\\{(x,0):x\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\chi_A\\in\\mathrm{NumComp}\\},\\qquad\nL(f)\\coloneqq\\{\\beta(x):x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\exists!y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{UnaryHead}(T,y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\exists!y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{UnaryHead}(T,y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\forall f:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl[(\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;f=\\varphi_e)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}\n\\bigl(\\{(\\beta(x),\\beta(y)):(x,y)\\in f\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\forall f:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl[(\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;f=\\varphi_e)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}\n\\bigl(\\{(\\beta(x),\\beta(y)):(x,y)\\in f\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RE}_{\\mathbb N}\n=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\widehat A\\in\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf2}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}\n=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\widehat A\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RE}_{\\mathbb N}\n=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\widehat A\\in\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf2}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}\n=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\widehat A\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有效解码、有限运行和前缀长度扫描使这两个编号一致有效；任一部分数值算法可先解码输入、模拟算法，再写出对应长度的全一前缀，故该编号覆盖所有部分数值可计算函数。原先未定义的数值编号由本册自己的机器编码补齐，不把它无说明地认作第 88 册的编号。所有新增函数均由显示的唯一图或有限和定义；没有在多个机器之间使用未经规定的选择。</p>\n<p>最后两个表示对应式把原文字中的“覆盖所有部分数值算法”与“数值集合的可计算性”连接到本册已有的字符串计算谓词和语言类。所用表示仍为同一个 β，普通编号不继承无关的神谕编码参数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-oracle-program-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"ab6c7ca255afa826","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-finite-runs","status":"resolved","id":"8630ed136c8dde2d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-finite-runs]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-partial-value-conventions","status":"resolved","id":"773cae915e5165f3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"888d8ab66ec7efca",