\\{\\beta(x):x\\in A\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{UnaryHead}(T,y)\\leftrightarrow\ny\\in\\mathbb N\\land T(y)\\ne1\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,y-1\\}\\;T(i)=1","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\varphi_e\\coloneqq\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\n\\exists M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_M\\;\n(\\operatorname{code}(M)=\\beta(e)\\land\nC_M^{\\mathsf{init}}(\\beta(x))\\to_M^*C\n\\land\\operatorname{Halting}_M(C)\\land\\operatorname{UnaryHead}(\\pi_2(C),y))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\varphi_e^A\\coloneqq\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^2:\n\\exists O\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\;\\exists C\\in\\operatorname{OConf}_O\\;\n(\\operatorname{ocode}(O)=\\beta(e)\\land\\pi_1(C)\\in\\{\\pi_8(O),\\pi_9(O)\\}\n\\land(C_O^{\\mathsf{in}}(\\beta(x)),C)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\operatorname{OConf}_O}(R_O^{\\widehat A})\n\\land\\operatorname{UnaryHead}(\\pi_1(\\pi_2(C)),y))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\operatorname{PFun}(\\varphi_e,\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\operatorname{PFun}(\\varphi_e^A,\\mathbb N,\\mathbb N))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NumComp}\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N:\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;f=\\varphi_e\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RE}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e):e\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\chi_A\\coloneqq\\{(x,1):x\\in A\\}\\cup\\{(x,0):x\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus A\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\chi_A\\in\\mathrm{NumComp}\\},\\qquad\nL(f)\\coloneqq\\{\\beta(x):x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\exists!y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{UnaryHead}(T,y)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\forall f:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl[(\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;f=\\varphi_e)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{PartialComp}_{\\mathbf2,\\mathbf2}\n\\bigl(\\{(\\beta(x),\\beta(y)):(x,y)\\in f\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}numeric\\text{-}program\\text{-}interface}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RE}_{\\mathbb N}\n=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\widehat A\\in\\mathsf{RE}_{\\mathbf2}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}\n=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\widehat A\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\\}","display":true}],"bytes":6775,"backlinks":[{"id":"6759b2502900015f","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"此 $\\mathrm{RE}$ 是可识别词语言类，不是 [[73-df-regular-language-algebra]] 中带参数的语言代数 $\\mathrm{RE}(\\Sigma)$；自然数载体实例见 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]] 的 $\\mathrm{RE}_{\\mathbb N}$。"},{"id":"ab2965eae370e771","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\varphi_e^A$、收敛域见 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]。"},{"id":"2a55bf7c4b509350","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in\\{\\mathbb N,\\mathbf2^*\\}$ 是固定载体，$A\\subseteq X$；$\\beta$ 见 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]，$\\operatorname{OTM}_B$, $L^B$, $\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^B$ 见 [[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]。"},{"id":"285f46d94947b99e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}$ 在词语言上下文为下述类；自然数上下文中的同一排版名称表示 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]] 的 $\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}$，载体必须在调用处声明。"},{"id":"bc9ff8728e77d8c2","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 在此为总字符串函数类，$\\mathrm{TotalComputable}$ 是其兼容别名；自然数载体的实例另由 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]] 的固定表示给出。"},{"id":"86e3771995bb6290","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]] 的 $\\varphi_e$、[[73-df-binary-program-coding]] 的 $\\mathcal E$；$\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}$。"},{"id":"192df17017774c0f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"数值函数类 $\\mathrm{NumComp}$ 见 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]；词函数的 $\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\Sigma,\\Sigma}$ 见 [[73-df-string-function-computation]]。"},{"id":"de1cd2013aed2d29","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$K$ 使用 [[73-df-typed-halting-set-notations]] 的固定角色 $\\kappa\\in\\{0,1\\}$；当 $\\kappa=0$ 时，$\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}$ 指 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]] 的 $\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}$；当 $\\kappa=1$ 时指 [[73-df-recursive-language-notation]] 的二进制词语言实例。"},{"id":"15bb24af84739cac","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\varphi_e$、$L(\\varphi_e)=\\{\\beta(x):x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\}$ 见 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]；本结论的 $\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}$ 取其数值集合实例 $\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}$。"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780","db96cabedd089e5f","ab6c7ca255afa826","8630ed136c8dde2d","773cae915e5165f3","888d8ab66ec7efca","fd9e85296ed6a24d","11b19b6d211be8ab","004d4e2ba3fdd14e"]}